        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='79576' hidden='true' id='8' story-point-id='6' type-v2='text' w='69631' x='2458' y='10938'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>STUDENT SOCIAL MEDIA ADDICTION ANALYSIS</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Introduction</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Social media has become an important part of students&apos; daily lives. Students use different social media platforms for communication, entertainment, education, and information sharing. However, excessive social media usage may be associated with addiction, reduced sleep, and academic difficulties.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This project explores student social media usage patterns and examines their relationship with addiction levels, sleeping habits, and academic performance.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Project Objectives</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Identify the most popular social media platforms among students.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Analyze average daily social media usage across academic levels.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Understand the distribution of student addiction scores.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Explore the relationship between social media usage and sleeping hours.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Examine the reported impact of social media on academic performance.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Dataset Overview</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Total Records:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> 705 students</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Total Features:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> 13</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Analysis Tool:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> Tableau</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Visualization Type:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> Interactive Dashboard and Data Story</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Key Areas of Analysis</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Platform Popularity | Daily Usage | Addiction Levels | Sleep Patterns | Academic Impact</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Project Goal</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>To transform student social media data into meaningful insights that help understand digital habits and their potential effects on student well-being and academic life.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='83705' hidden='true' id='9' story-point-id='7' type-v2='text' w='68169' x='2809' y='12054'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>KEY FINDINGS &amp; CONCLUSION</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Key Findings</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>1. Social Media Platform Popularity</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Instagram is the most-used platform among the students.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>TikTok and Facebook are also highly popular.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>2. Daily Social Media Usage</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Average daily usage is approximately </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>4.9 hours</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>High School students show the highest average usage among the three academic levels in this dataset.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>3. Addiction Score Analysis</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The average addiction score is approximately </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>6.4 out of 10</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Scores are concentrated around the middle-to-higher range, with score 7 appearing most frequently.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>4. Sleep Patterns</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The scatter plot shows a general negative relationship between daily social media usage and sleeping hours.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Students with higher usage tend to show lower sleep durations in the dataset.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>5. Academic Performance</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Approximately </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>64.26%</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> of students report that social media affects their academic performance.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This highlights the importance of understanding students&apos; social media habits.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Conclusion</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The analysis reveals that social media plays a significant role in students&apos; daily routines. Instagram is the leading platform, while average daily usage is approximately 4.9 hours.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The visualizations also show patterns between social media usage, addiction scores, sleeping hours, and reported academic impact.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This project demonstrates how Tableau can be used to explore real-world data, identify patterns, and communicate meaningful insights through interactive visualizations.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Final Takeaway</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Responsible social media usage and a healthy balance between digital activities, sleep, and academics are important for student well-being.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{005A1CFE-3B70-4E11-8812-87167D7C9AD0}' />
